<p>Strike with each of your weapons, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">115%, 130%, 141%, 151%, 160%</acronym> acid weapon damage with each hit.</p><p>If at least one of the strikes hits, an acid splash is generated, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> acid damage to all enemies in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> around the foe you struck.</p><p>The splash damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>